folidstruct (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Custom blocks in the project folder name: fixed text, fields to fill
    in and choices from a list; empty blocks are skipped.
  * All blocks, including date, number and project name, can be reordered.
  * Choice of separator: space, underscore, hyphen or spaced hyphen.
  * Each template has its own progressive number.
  * Existing settings are converted automatically.

